{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790966797,"nonce":"LscTxVHvLXFo0kXoevSv4/N6bL8=","title":"Composite-promoted CSS overlay fades (cn dropdowns) froze mid-animation until mouse-move;","message":"cn dropdown enter-fades (menubar/select/combobox, `cn-dropdown-menu-enter` = opacity+scale+translateY) played a frame or two then froze until the next input event; text opacity especially. RESOLVED. Web/wasm never had this (it re-collects every rAF frame on one slow path with no `start_all_css_animations` re-entry).\n\n**Three independent frozen-cache paths, one root pattern.** A promotable CSS overlay subtree is baked once to a `LayerTexture` and blitted per-frame with live opacity/transform by `composite_css_layers_overlay`. On the compositor fast path the walker doesn't re-run, so anything baked at the animation's CURRENT value freezes.\n\n1. **Redraw chain died.** Once the push frame's dirty flags cleared, no term kept redraws flowing (cn fades are CSS `@keyframes`, not the motion FSM, so `has_animating_overlays()` misses them; the promoted container isn't reliably in `painted_node_ids`, so painted-gated `css_needs_redraw` misses it too). Fix (windowed.rs): `overlay_css_needs_redraw = overlay_present \u0026\u0026 css_has_active()` OR'd into the redraw signal (bounded — clears when the anim settles or the overlay closes).\n2. **bg/border/shadow baked at fading opacity.** Fix (motion.rs): bake the promoted subtree at BASE opacity (`bake_opacity = 1.0` when `pushed_for_css`) so the per-frame blit drives the fade. Shadow prims also pad the baked AABB by their halo (`blur*3 + |offset| + spread`) in `bg_primitive_aabb` (paint.rs) or the drop shadow is cropped out of the tight bake.\n3. **Text/SVG glyph alpha + transform baked at collect, frozen on fast path.** Fix (context.rs): under a promoted ancestor, collect text/SVG at BASE alpha (composite factor excluded), tag each with `composite_ancestor` (a StableNodeId), record emitted prim ranges into `motion_subtree_text_patch`, and in `dispatch_motion_subtree_overlay_pools` multiply the LIVE store opacity into `prim.color[3]` AND re-anchor glyph centers with the same top-left blit math every frame. No re-collect → no flicker/replay (the earlier force-slow-path attempt caused exactly that and was reverted).\n\n**Settle/demote:** invalidate the render cache on BOTH edges of `css_has_active()` (windowed.rs `prev_css_active`): rising edge re-collects with `is_playing` true (captures promotion + patch records past the first-open ordering race); falling edge demotes and re-emits the subtree at its exact final state (the fast path never demotes on its own).\n\nInline `.foreground()` panels (select/combobox) need the extra fix in gotcha foreground breaks composite promotion. Distinct from gotcha context menu invisible until mouse motion (first-frame invisibility, fixed via mount-texture invalidation) and gotcha tooltip css fade text invisible (a workaround that avoided opacity fades entirely — this makes them actually work). Commit `f850a50f`.","files":null}]}